---
/**
 * Past Circles - history of previous gatherings with galleries
 */
---

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="minule-title">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 id="minule-title">Minule kruhy</h2>
    <hr class="divider" />

    <!-- 19. 2. 2026 -->
    <article class="past-event">
      <div class="past-event__header">
        <p class="past-event__date">19. 2. 2026 17:30</p>
        <p class="past-event__location">Adamov</p>
      </div>
      <h3>Nase Zavislosti &ndash; Pani alebo Otroci?</h3>
      <p>
        Pekne postanicko u ohna a priznajme si, kto z nas chlapov viac ci menej
        prejavene je alebo aspon bol vnutorne pyroman zavislostou :)?
      </p>
      <div class="gallery gallery--four">
        <img
          src="/images/gallery03/dfa6b9ac.jpg"
          alt="Pyroman"
          width="506"
          height="900"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src="/images/gallery03/cfbc7686.jpg"
          alt="To je ziar!"
          width="506"
          height="900"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src="/images/gallery03/8453a2c9.jpg"
          alt="Stromcek upaleny"
          width="506"
          height="900"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src="/images/gallery03/3bae7497.jpg"
          alt="Zima velika"
          width="506"
          height="900"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </article>

    <hr class="divider--wide" />

    <!-- 4. 2. 2026 -->
    <article class="past-event">
      <div class="past-event__header">
        <p class="past-event__date">4. 2. 2026 17:30</p>
        <p class="past-event__location">Lysice</p>
      </div>
      <h3>Slovo ako zbran</h3>
      <p>
        K tejto teme ma inspirovalo video s Jordanom Petersonom:
        <a
          href="https://youtu.be/2FTx7DV7sv8?si=cLfpgXzbbwiFDA_9"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >This Is How You Become More Articulate</a
        >
      </p>
      <p>
        Nakoniec sme sa u nas na zahrade zisli v peknom pocte 4. Staronova
        kombinacia.
      </p>
      <img
        src="/images/image06.jpg"
        alt="Stretnutie pri ohni - slovo ako zbran"
        class="rounded-img past-event__single-img"
        width="1184"
        height="864"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </article>

    <hr class="divider--wide" />

    <!-- 21. 1. 2026 -->
    <article class="past-event">
      <div class="past-event__header">
        <p class="past-event__date">21. 1. 2026 17:30</p>
        <p class="past-event__location">Zernovnik &ndash; u Vladimira</p>
      </div>
      <h3>Sex</h3>
      <p>
        Tentokrat sme vyuzili zazemia Vladimira, ktory sa sice zdielanim
        nepripojil, ale zdielanie to bolo aj tak hlboke. Ponorili sme sa
        nakratko aj do pramennych jazierok na pozemku a stravili kruh pod
        hviezdami.
      </p>
      <p>
        Tema zda sa tak siroka, ze mozno by stalo za to ju zopakovat, pripadne
        vypichnut konkretnu cast podtemou, nech dokazeme viac smerovat nasu
        pozornost.
      </p>
      <div class="gallery">
        <img
          src="/images/gallery01/5017e92a.jpg"
          alt="Ohnivy zivel"
          width="621"
          height="900"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src="/images/gallery01/f7995c85.jpg"
          alt="Vodny kontrast"
          width="1020"
          height="900"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </article>

    <hr class="divider--wide" />

    <!-- 7. 1. 2026 -->
    <article class="past-event">
      <div class="past-event__header">
        <p class="past-event__date">7. 1. 2026 17:30</p>
        <p class="past-event__location">Bilovice u Jirky</p>
      </div>
      <h3>Prve Hranice &ndash; Kde sa to cele zacalo?</h3>
      <p>
        Nakoniec sme sa zisli styria. Bolo to necakane a o to lepsie. Nacali sme
        temu, ktora zda sa dotyka viacero muzov. Viac v nasledujucom termine.
      </p>
      <p>
        Jirka poskytol vyborne zazemie, v kontraste s poslednou navstevou v lete
        sme sa teraz stretli aj lucili uz po tme a bez triciek sme teda tiez
        neboli :-).
      </p>
      <img
        src="/images/image05.jpg"
        alt="Nocny ohen v zime"
        class="rounded-img past-event__single-img"
        width="895"
        height="894"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </article>

    <hr class="divider--wide" />

    <!-- 29. 9. 2025 -->
    <article class="past-event">
      <div class="past-event__header">
        <p class="past-event__date">29. 9. 2025 17:30</p>
        <p class="past-event__location"
          >Babi doly &ndash; s moznostou kupacky :)</p
        >
      </div>
      <h3>Pasce a Slobody v Zivote Muza</h3>
      <p>
        Existuju knihy a teorie (ako napriklad
        <a
          href="https://selfdefinition.org/psychology/Esther-Vilar-The-Manipulated-Man.pdf"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >&bdquo;Manipulovany muz&ldquo; od Esther Vilar</a
        >), ktore provokativne tvrdia, ze muzi su v spolocnosti manipulovani a
        chyteni do pasce roli, ktore od nich ocakavaju zeny a spolocnost. Ze sme
        vychovavani k tomu, aby sme boli vykonni zivitelia a ochrancovia, a za
        odmenu dostavame prijatie a intimitu.
      </p>
      <p>
        Kruh piatich muzov dokonca s dvomi odvazlivcami, ktori skocili do vody
        bol opat vyzivny. Knihu manipulativny muz nechavam v historii, keby si
        chcel niekto prestudovat a pripomenut co bolo inspiraciou temy.
      </p>
      <div class="gallery">
        <img
          src="/images/gallery02/11e02508.jpg"
          alt="Babi lom za svetla"
          width="1213"
          height="899"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src="/images/gallery02/d272647a.jpg"
          alt="Babi lom za tmy pri ohni"
          width="1062"
          height="900"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .past-event {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .past-event__header {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-sm) var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .past-event__date {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .past-event__location {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .past-event h3 {
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: none;
    color: var(--color-heading);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .past-event__single-img {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    max-width: 100%;
  }
</style>
